        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    If you are unsure how to weigh a lateral-entry MBA against a regular MBA, an Executive MBA, or
    staying in your current role a little longer, a session inside
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you run this specific comparison with an actual person instead of guessing from an
    admission counsellor's pitch.
  </p>

  <h2 id="mistakes">Mistakes people make with this route</h2>

  <div class="mistakes-list">
    {mistakeItems.map((item) => (
